<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 600 million.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 600 million.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 600 million pounds for auction on March 3 and issue on March 4 when 182-day bills worth 629.625 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 9.990 percent.</p>
</text>
